<title>GERMANY: Daimler sees all segments in profit in 97.</title>
<headline>Daimler sees all segments in profit in 97.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Daimler-Benz AG said on Wednesday it expected all its business segments to turn an operating profit in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;I forecast that all business segments will have a positive result,&quot; management board chairman Juergen Schrempp told a news conference.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
